  "title": "蛾",
  "created": 1789924557,
  "updated": 1789928328,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ab014ca32faf483bfd0e524",
      "text": "蛾",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1789924557,
      "updated": 1789924557
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab014cc000000000043a19f",
      "text": "　月や星の光によって進路を決める。結果として、人口照明に捕まってしまう",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1789924557,
      "updated": 1789924733
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab01587000000000043a1a1",
      "text": "　蛾と蝶は共通の祖先から分岐した。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1789924744,
      "updated": 1789928328
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab016a0000000000043a1a2",
      "text": "　多くの蛾は成虫になるとほとんど何も食べない。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1789925027,
      "updated": 1789925108
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab02045000000000043a1a4",
      "text": "　コンピュータバグの最初の原因",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1789927494,
      "updated": 1789927650
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab020e0000000000043a1a5",
